
# ShopGuard AI

A machine learning-based fraud detection system for identifying potentially fraudulent e-commerce websites.

## Project Overview

ShopGuard AI analyzes website characteristics, domain information, SSL certificate attributes, payment features, and online trust indicators to identify patterns associated with fraudulent online shops.

## Objectives

- Analyze fraudulent and legitimate online shops.
- Perform exploratory data analysis.
- Investigate missing values and data quality.
- Apply feature engineering and preprocessing.
- Develop and compare machine learning models.
- Evaluate model performance.
- Investigate model interpretability.

## Technology Stack

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab
- Jupyter Notebook

